#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulation.rst:5 32589c061a744bb7b405152e075887c9
msgid "MATLAB Simulation"
msgstr "MATLAB 仿真"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulation.rst:10 7fee6c1372434738929f018367643659
msgid ""
"MATLAB can be connected directly to ArduPilot using the JSON SITL interface."
" A connection function is provided along with a copter example. The "
"connection function deals with the UDP communications with ArduPilot. The "
"copter example also contains a `function "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/afa153fb6fb569419455eb37384a1889971bd5bf/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Copter/SIM_multicopter.m#L127>`__"
" to deal with the 6 dof dynamics of the system using the ArduPilot reference"
" frames and conventions. This allows new vehicle types to only output a "
"calculated force and moment given the vehicles state and PWM inputs. The "
"example code is thoroughly commented and can be found in the `main "
"repository "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Copter>`__."
msgstr ""
"MATLAB 可通过 JSON SITL (软件在环仿真) 接口直接连接到 "
"ArduPilot。系统提供了一个连接函数和一个多旋翼示例。连接函数负责处理与 ArduPilot 的 UDP 通信。多旋翼示例还包含一个 `函数 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/afa153fb6fb569419455eb37384a1889971bd5bf/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Copter/SIM_multicopter.m#L127>`__，用于处理系统的"
" 6 自由度动力学，采用 ArduPilot 的参考坐标系和约定。这使得新机型只需根据飞行器状态和 PWM "
"输入输出计算所得的力和力矩。示例代码有详细注释，可在 `主仓库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/SITL/examples/JSON/MATLAB/Copter>`__"
" 中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulation.rst:16 2cfa0dbf7b6c4533a6fd46027707fe39
msgid ""
"In order to connect MATLAB run the standard SITL command followed with ``-f "
"JSON:127.0.0.1`` where, if necessary, ``127.0.0.1`` is replaced by the IP of"
" the machine where MATLAB is running. There is no requirement for MATLAB and"
" SITL to be on the same system, however firewall exceptions may need to be "
"added for both. Both MATLAB and SITL can be stopped and restarted and the "
"other should re-connect. Break-points will work as normal."
msgstr ""
"要连接 MATLAB，运行标准 SITL 命令并在末尾加上 ``-f JSON:127.0.0.1``，如有需要，将 ``127.0.0.1`` "
"替换为运行 MATLAB 的机器的 IP。MATLAB 和 SITL 不必在同一系统上，但两者可能都需要添加防火墙例外。MATLAB 和 SITL "
"均可停止并重启，另一方应能重新连接。断点将正常工作。"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulation.rst:22 7c0144e00ccd4c6495a3815b6b6dc47f
msgid ""
"If you're running Matlab (within windows) and SITL (within WSL2) in the same"
" machine:"
msgstr "如果您在同一台机器上运行 Matlab（在 Windows 中）和 SITL（在 WSL2 中）："

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulation.rst:24 9d815afcd6b541e497cc1b5a5ddffb48
msgid ""
"If you've enabled mirrored mode networking in WSL2 you have to disable it "
"first. You can read more about this in this article: "
"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/networking#mirrored-mode-"
"networking. (Note: To apply changes you've made to the .wslconfig file, "
"you'll have to restart the WSL.)"
msgstr ""
"如果您在 WSL2 中启用了镜像模式网络，则必须首先禁用它。您可以在此文章中了解更多信息：https://learn.microsoft.com/en-"
"us/windows/wsl/networking#mirrored-mode-networking。（注意：要应用对 .wslconfig "
"文件所做的更改，您需要重启 WSL。）"

#: ../../source/docs/MATLAB-Simulation.rst:25 7ee09a38973a4c61aa780685450478f3
msgid ""
"You can find the ip address that you should replace 127.0.0.1 with by "
"running ``ipconfig`` command in windows PowerShell. (You have to use the ip "
"address under the Ethernet Adapter vEthernet (WSL (Hyper-V firewall). eg: "
"172.xx.xx.x)"
msgstr ""
"您可以通过在 Windows PowerShell 中运行 ``ipconfig`` 命令来查找应替换 127.0.0.1 的 IP "
"地址。（您需要使用以太网适配器 vEthernet (WSL (Hyper-V 防火墙)) 下的 IP 地址，例如：172.xx.xx.x）"
